  "note": "Verona: the fountain in the piazza by day; the Capulets’ feast on lute, recorder and tabor; the garden at night with crickets and the nightingale; the dawn the lovers would deny; the friar’s stone cell; Juliet’s still chamber; the vault. The lovers’ theme on solo violin over a harp; the church organ for the wedding and the dirges; the passing bell for every death.",
